---
// Static hero variant V5 — Editorial broadsheet.
// Top-aligned layout reminiscent of a journal masthead: a small
// section index ("№ 01" / catalog cycle) anchors a pull-quote-style
// statement, with CTAs presented as a thin nav-bar at the bottom of
// the content column. The pair of CTAs is read as one element thanks
// to the connecting vertical divider.
---

<div class="relative z-10 w-full md:w-1/2 px-5 sm:px-8 md:px-12 lg:px-16 xl:px-20 py-12 md:py-0 max-w-2xl">
  {/* Masthead line: number + label + thin rule */}
  <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-8 sm:mb-10">
    <span class="font-serif italic text-base sm:text-lg text-[color:var(--fg-muted)] leading-none">
      № 01
    </span>
    <span class="block flex-1 h-px bg-[color:var(--fg-muted)]/40"></span>
    <span class="uppercase text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] tracking-[0.32em] text-[color:var(--fg-muted)]">
      Casa de Asterión
    </span>
  </div>

  {/* Statement — large pull-quote style */}
  <p class="font-serif text-[1.85rem] sm:text-[2.4rem] md:text-[2.7rem] lg:text-[3.2rem] xl:text-[3.6rem] leading-[1.08] text-[color:var(--fg)] mb-7 sm:mb-9">
    Libros que no se apuran:
    <span class="italic"> filosofía y poesía</span> editadas con
    <span class="italic"> tiempo</span> y oficio.
  </p>

  {/* Three short editorial principles, inline & comma-separated, like
      a masthead would render its tagline. */}
  <p class="text-[13px] sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[color:var(--fg-muted)] mb-10 sm:mb-12">
    Traducir bien · Editar despacio · Imprimir bonito
  </p>

  {/* CTA bar — two cells separated by a thin rule, reads as one unit. */}
  <div class="inline-flex items-stretch border-y border-[color:var(--fg)]/20">
    <a
      href="/catalogo"
      class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 pr-6 sm:pr-8 py-4 sm:py-5 text-[11px] sm:text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.26em] text-[color:var(--fg)] hover:text-[color:var(--fg-muted)] transition-colors"
    >
      <span class="font-serif italic text-[color:var(--fg-muted)] text-sm normal-case tracking-normal mr-1">
        Catálogo
      </span>
      <span class="block w-6 h-px bg-current"></span>
      Ver libros
      <svg
        width="14"
        height="14"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="1.6"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
        class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <path d="M5 12h14" />
        <path d="m13 5 7 7-7 7" />
      </svg>
    </a>
    <span class="w-px bg-[color:var(--fg)]/20"></span>
    <a
      href="/articulos"
      class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-6 sm:px-8 py-4 sm:py-5 text-[11px] sm:text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.26em] text-[color:var(--fg-muted)] hover:text-[color:var(--fg)] transition-colors"
    >
      <span class="font-serif italic text-sm normal-case tracking-normal mr-1">
        Archivo
      </span>
      <span class="block w-6 h-px bg-current"></span>
      Publicaciones
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
